dby=\"svc-h\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<div class=\"sec-head\">\n<hr class=\"ledger\"/>\n<h2 id=\"svc-h\">What we do for your business.</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card-grid\">\n<article class=\"svc-card\">\n<div class=\"ci\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 21V7l7-4 7 4v14M2 21h20M9 9h.01M9 13h.01M9 17h.01M14 9h.01M14 13h.01M14 17h.01\"/></svg></div>\n<h3>Company Registration</h3>\n<p>We assist with all aspects of company incorporation, including filing necessary documents, registering your business name, and obtaining required licenses. Our services ensure your business is legally compliant and ready to operate smoothly from day one.</p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"svc-card\">\n<div class=\"ci\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"/><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"/></svg></div>\n<h3>Bookkeeping</h3>\n<p>Stay organized and in control with our precise bookkeeping services. We handle your financial records with accuracy, ensuring up-to-date data that helps you make informed business decisions while saving you time and stress.</p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"svc-card\">\n<div class=\"ci\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 7l-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17\"/><path d=\"M16 7h6v6\"/></svg></div>\n<h3>Fractional CFO</h3>\n<p>Gain access to expert financial leadership with our Fractional CFO services. From cash flow management to strategic planning, we provide the insights and strategies needed to drive your business toward long-term success.</p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"svc-card\">\n<div class=\"ci\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 2h12l4 4v16H4z\"/><path d=\"M8 8h8M8 12h8M8 16h5\"/></svg></div>\n<h3>Tax Preparation</h3>\n<p>Streamline your tax season with our reliable and efficient tax preparation services. We ensure timely filings, minimize errors, and keep you stress-free with accurate documentation tailored to your specific needs.</p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"svc-card\">\n<div class=\"ci\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16 2v4M8 2v4M3 10h18\"/></svg></div>\n<h3>Tax Planning</h3>\n<p>Plan ahead and save more with our proactive tax planning solutions. We help you navigate complex regulations, minimize liabilities, and maximize savings, ensuring your business remains compliant and profitable year-round.</p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"svc-card\">\n<div class=\"ci\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-8 9-4.5-1.5-8-4-8-9V6l8-3 8 3z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></div>\n<h3>Tax Resolution</h3>\n<p>Resolve your tax issues with confidence through our expert tax resolution services. From managing IRS notices to negotiating payment plans, we help you navigate challenges and regain control.</p>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"dsec on-dark\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(900px 460px at 80% -20%, rgba(62,125,110,0.26), transparent 60%), linear-gradient(160deg,#143b44,#0c252b);\" aria-labelledby=\"process-h\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<div class=\"sec-head\">\n<hr class=\"ledger\"/>\n<h2 id=\"process-h\">Our Process in Four Easy Steps</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"steps\">\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"n\">1</div><div class=\"bar\"/><h3><a href=\"/appointment/1\">Schedule a Consultation</a></h3><p>Book a time to meet with our experts to discuss your financial needs and goals.</p></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"n\">2</div><div class=\"bar\"/><h3>Comprehensive Analysis</h3><p>We dive deep into your financial data to identify key opportunities and challenges.</p></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"n\">3</div><div class=\"bar\"/><h3>Review and Customize Your Plan</h3><p>Receive a detailed proposal with tailored services and solutions.</p></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"n\">4</div><div class=\"bar\"/><h3>Sign The Contract and Let's Begin</h3><p>Finalize the agreement, and we'll handle the rest while you focus on growth.</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"dsec\" style=\"background:var(--surface);\" aria-labelledby=\"quotes-h\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<div class=\"sec-head\">\n<hr class=\"ledger\"/>\n<h2 id=\"quotes-h\">What clients say.</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"quotes-grid\">\n<figure class=\"testi-card\" style=\"margin:0;\">\n<div class=\"stars\" aria-hidden=\"true\">★★★★★</div>\n<blockquote>“I spent a long time searching for a company that could handle the bookkeeping and accounting for our e-com business, which operates across multiple sales channels and has numerous integrations. This company exceeded my expectations. They are highly professional, thorough, and have a deep understanding of complex business needs. Their expertise has brought a lot of clarity and organization to our financial processes, and I would highly recommend them to any business looking for reliable and skilled accounting services.”</blockquote>\n<figcaption class=\"by\">Michael Zavyalov — CEO</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"testi-card\" style=\"margin:0;\">\n<div class=\"stars\" aria-hidden=\"true\">★★★★★</div>\n<blockquote>“I’ve been working with Julia and Maria for a while now. They go above and beyond with their work and put genuine efforts while doing things. Every single meeting they propose new procedures and processes that would save time and make everyone’s work more efficient. That is exactly what makes them different from any other adviser that I’ve worked with.”</blockquote>\n<figcaption class=\"by\">Marko Zivanovic — Owner at Prime Road Carriers INC</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"testi-card\" style=\"margin:0;\">\n<div class=\"stars\" aria-hidden=\"true\">★★★★★</div>\n<blockquote>“In all honesty, our company is thrilled to have found Julia and her staff. At first we were hesitant because of the price. But now, we feel so lucky and blessed. They came in and implemented necessary procedures and cleaned us up. Finally an accounting firm who cares. They gave us a lot, I mean a lot, of work to do, just like a good hard coach of a basketball or football team would do. All the other companies we had used did the least amount of work and gave no advice. We/I highly recommend them if you have a serious business. They become part of the team!”</blockquote>\n<figcaption class=\"by\">Edward Kissel — Owner of Mobilesource Corp</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"dsec\" style=\"background:var(--greige-100);\" aria-labelledby=\"partners-h\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<div class=\"sec-head center\">\n<hr class=\"ledger\"/>\n<h2 id=\"partners-h\">Our Valued Partners</h2>\n<p class=\"lede\">We are in good company.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"partners-grid\">\n<img src=\"/web/image/636-e9aa9854/2560px-Intuit_QuickBooks_logo.svg.webp\" alt=\"Intuit QuickBooks\" loading=\"lazy\"/>\n<img src=\"/web/image/646-48c4ebae/2.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"/>\n<img src=\"/web/image/645-fdb25496/3.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"/>\n<img src=\"/web/image/647-2cb7f14f/4.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"/>\n<img src=\"/web/image/648-712fd4ba/5.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"